# Declare Independence below the Sons of Liberty gate. Fixture: France 1599 (map_found_colony input.sav as is): the French colonies
# (Quebec, Montreal, Guadeloupe, Martinique, Port au Prince) average 48% rebels, below the 50% DECLARE_SOL_MIN gate.
# GAME menu row "DECLARE INDEPENDENCE" (logical y 85) only shows the @TOOTORY notice ("Only 48% ... cannot start a rebellion ...");
# nothing is declared, no WoI/REF/latch writes. Close the notice with Enter, then again with a click to cover both routes.
click 22 3               # GAME menu
click 50 85              # DECLARE INDEPENDENCE: @TOOTORY notice
wait 10
key Return               # dismiss the notice
wait 10
click 22 3               # GAME menu again
click 50 85              # DECLARE INDEPENDENCE again: same notice
wait 10
shot
click 160 100            # a click on the notice dismisses it too
wait 10
